$$
\left\{
\frac15,\frac45
\right\},
\qquad
\left\{
\frac25,\frac35
\right\}.
$$

定义：

$$
\boxed{
\Delta_1
=
2\sin\frac{\pi}{5},
}
\tag{840.1}
$$

$$
\boxed{
\Delta_2
=
2\sin\frac{2\pi}{5}.
}
\tag{840.2}
$$

